   "version": 1,
   "text": "\"Add muted dub-chord shadows, filtered rhythmic ghosts, distant metallic\n echoes and gentle analog grit only as background textures.\"\n\"... culminating in a deeper rolling peak without a new lead hook.\"\n\"No vocals, trance leads, industrial aggression, festival risers or EDM drops.\"",
   "originalText": "\"Add muted dub-chord shadows, filtered rhythmic ghosts, distant metallic\n echoes and gentle analog grit only as background textures.\"\n\"... culminating in a deeper rolling peak without a new lead hook.\"\n\"No vocals, trance leads, industrial aggression, festival risers or EDM drops.\"",
